#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:1
msgid "Quickstart-vLLM"
msgstr "快速入门-vLLM"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:2
msgid ""
"This document describes how to install unified-cache-management with vllm"
" on cuda platform."
msgstr ""
"本文档介绍如何在 cuda 平台上安装带 vllm 的 unified-cache-management。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:4
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前提条件"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:5
msgid ""
"vllm >=0.9.1, device=cuda (Sparse Feature is supported in vllm 0.9.2 and "
"v0.11.0)"
msgstr ""
"vllm >=0.9.1, device=cuda（稀疏特性在 vllm 0.9.2 和 v0.11.0 中支持）"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:7
msgid "Step 1: UCM Installation"
msgstr "第 1 步：安装 UCM"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:9
msgid "We offer 3 options to install UCM."
msgstr "我们提供了 3 种安装 UCM 的方式。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:11
msgid "Option 1: Setup from docker"
msgstr "选项 1：通过 docker 进行设置"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:13
msgid "Official pre-built image"
msgstr "官方预构建镜像"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:18
msgid "Then run your container using following command."
msgstr "然后使用以下命令运行你的容器。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:32
msgid "Build image from source"
msgstr "从源码构建镜像"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:37
msgid ""
"Check the `docker/` directory for available Dockerfile versions (e.g. "
"`v0.20.2`, `v0.18.0`, `v0.17.0`, `v0.11.0`), then build with the desired "
"version:"
msgstr ""
"检查 `docker/` 目录下可用的 Dockerfile 版本（例如 `v0.20.2`、`v0.18.0`、"
"`v0.17.0`、`v0.11.0`），然后使用所需的版本进行构建："

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:43
msgid "For vLLM(v0.11.0) with sparse attention support:"
msgstr "对于支持稀疏注意力的 vLLM（v0.11.0）："

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:48
msgid ""
"The Dockerfile automatically invokes the build script "
"(`scripts/build_cuda.sh`) to compile the wheel and installs from the "
"built package."
msgstr ""
"Dockerfile 会自动调用构建脚本（`scripts/build_cuda.sh`）来编译 wheel 包，"
"并从构建出的安装包进行安装。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:50
msgid "Build image from pre-built package"
msgstr "从预构建的软件包构建镜像"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:52
msgid ""
"If you have a pre-built tar package (e.g. from CI), extract it and build "
"the image in `package` mode:"
msgstr ""
"如果你有预构建的 tar 包（例如来自 CI），请解压它并以 `package` 模式构建镜像："

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:61
msgid "Option 2: Build from source"
msgstr "选项 2：从源码构建"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:62
#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:171
msgid "Prepare vLLM Environment"
msgstr "准备 vLLM 环境"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:64
msgid ""
"For the sake of environment isolation and simplicity, we recommend "
"preparing the vLLM environment by pulling the official, pre-built vLLM "
"Docker image."
msgstr ""
"出于环境隔离和简单性的考虑，我们建议通过拉取官方的 vLLM Docker 预构建镜像来准备 vLLM 环境。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:69
msgid "Use the following command to run your own container:"
msgstr "使用以下命令运行你自己的容器："

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:82
msgid ""
"Refer to [Set up using "
"docker](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/getting_started/installation/gpu.html"
"#set-up-using-docker) for more information to run your own vLLM "
"container."
msgstr ""
"有关运行你自己的 vLLM 容器的更多信息，请参阅 [使用 docker 进行设置]"
"(https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/getting_started/installation/gpu.html"
"#set-up-using-docker)。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:84
msgid "Build From Source Code"
msgstr "从源码构建"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:86
msgid "Follow commands below to install unified-cache-management:"
msgstr "按照下面的命令安装 unified-cache-management："

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:88
msgid ""
"**Note:** The sparse module was not compiled by default. To enable it, "
"set the environment variable `export ENABLE_SPARSE=TRUE` before you "
"build."
msgstr ""
"**注意：** 稀疏模块默认不会编译。要启用它，请在构建前设置环境变量 "
"`export ENABLE_SPARSE=TRUE`。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:98
msgid "Apply vLLM Integration Patches"
msgstr "应用 vLLM 集成补丁"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:100
msgid ""
"To integrate UCM with vLLM, you can choose between a dynamic **monkey "
"patch** (recommended) and a manual **git patch**."
msgstr ""
"要将 UCM 与 vLLM 集成，你可以在动态 **monkey patch**（推荐）和手动 **git patch** 之间进行选择。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:102
msgid ""
"**Recommendation**: We highly recommend the Monkey Patch approach for its"
" non-invasive nature and ease of use."
msgstr ""
"**建议**：我们强烈推荐使用 Monkey Patch 方式，因为它无侵入且易于使用。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:104
msgid "Option A: Monkey Patch (Recommended)"
msgstr "选项 A：Monkey Patch（推荐）"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:106
msgid ""
"This method enables UCM features dynamically at runtime via environment "
"variables, requiring no source code modifications.  It automatically "
"detects the vLLM version and applies patches only when needed — you can "
"safely keep it enabled regardless of your vLLM version.  Available for "
"vLLM ≥ 0.11.0 (not supported on 0.9.2, which requires Manual Git Patch)."
msgstr ""
"这种方法通过环境变量在运行时动态启用 UCM 特性，无需修改源代码。它会自动检测 "
"vLLM 版本，并仅在需要时应用补丁——无论你的 vLLM 版本如何，你都可以安全地保持其启用。"
"适用于 vLLM ≥ 0.11.0（0.9.2 不受支持，需要手动 Git Patch）。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:110
msgid "Enable Monkey Patch:"
msgstr "启用 Monkey Patch："

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:115
msgid "Enable Sparse Attention (Optional, vLLM 0.11.0 only):"
msgstr "启用稀疏注意力（可选，仅限 vLLM 0.11.0）："

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:120
msgid "**Note:**"
msgstr "**注意：**"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:121
msgid "ReRoPE support is currently only available via the Git Patch method."
msgstr "目前只有通过 Git Patch 方式才能使用 ReRoPE 支持。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:123
msgid ""
"Option B: Manual Git Patch (Legacy/Alternative, only available for vLLM "
"0.9.2 and 0.11.0)"
msgstr ""
"选项 B：手动 Git Patch（旧版/备选方案，仅适用于 vLLM 0.9.2 和 0.11.0）"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:125
msgid "If you prefer modifying the source code directly, follow these steps:"
msgstr "如果你更喜欢直接修改源代码，请按照以下步骤操作："

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:127
msgid "1. Navigate to the vLLM source directory:"
msgstr "1. 切换到 vLLM 源码目录："

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:131
msgid "2. Apply the patch that corresponds to your vLLM version and requirements:"
msgstr "2. 应用与你的 vLLM 版本和需求对应的补丁："

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:133
msgid "vLLM 0.9.2"
msgstr "vLLM 0.9.2"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:134
#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:151
msgid "Full UCM integration (recommended):"
msgstr "完整的 UCM 集成（推荐）："

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:139
#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:156
msgid "Sparse attention only:"
msgstr "仅稀疏注意力："

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:144
#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:161
msgid "ReRoPE support only:"
msgstr "仅 ReRoPE 支持："

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:149
msgid "vLLM 0.11.0"
msgstr "vLLM 0.11.0"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:166
msgid ""
"Choose the patch according to your development needs.  If you are working"
" on **sparse attention** or **ReRoPE** independently, applying only the "
"corresponding patch is sufficient."
msgstr ""
"请根据你的开发需求选择补丁。如果你正在独立开发 **稀疏注意力** 或 **ReRoPE** 功能，"
"只需应用对应的补丁即可。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:170
msgid "Option 3: Install by pip"
msgstr "选项 3：通过 pip 安装"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:173
msgid ""
"It is recommended to use a pre-build vllm docker image, please follow the"
" guide in Option 2."
msgstr ""
"建议使用预构建的 vllm docker 镜像，请按照选项 2 中的指南操作。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:175
msgid "install by pip"
msgstr "通过 pip 安装"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:177
msgid ""
"Install by pip or find the pre-build wheels on "
"[Pypi](https://pypi.org/project/uc-manager/)."
msgstr ""
"通过 pip 安装，或在 [Pypi](https://pypi.org/project/uc-manager/) 上查找预构建的 wheel 包。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:182
msgid ""
"**Note:** If installing via `pip install`, you need to manually add the "
"`config.yaml` file, similar to `unified-cache-"
"management/examples/ucm_config_example.yaml`, because PyPI packages do "
"not include YAML files."
msgstr ""
"**注意：** 如果通过 `pip install` 安装，你需要手动添加 `config.yaml` 文件，"
"参考 `unified-cache-management/examples/ucm_config_example.yaml`，因为 PyPI "
"软件包不包含 YAML 文件。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:184
msgid "Step 2: Configuration"
msgstr "第 2 步：配置"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:186
msgid "Features Overview"
msgstr "功能概览"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:188
msgid ""
"UCM supports two key features: **Prefix Cache** and **Sparse attention**."
" Each feature supports both **Offline Inference** and **Online API** "
"modes. More details are available via the links"
msgstr ""
"UCM 支持两个关键功能：**Prefix Cache**（前缀缓存）和 **Sparse attention**"
"（稀疏注意力）。每个功能都支持 **Offline Inference**（离线推理）和 **Online API**"
"（在线 API）两种模式。更多详情可通过以下链接获取"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:189
msgid "[Prefix Cache](../user-guide/prefix-cache/index.md)"
msgstr "[前缀缓存](../user-guide/prefix-cache/index.md)"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:190
msgid "[GSA Sparsity](../user-guide/sparse-attention/gsa.md)"
msgstr "[GSA 稀疏](../user-guide/sparse-attention/gsa.md)"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:192
msgid ""
"For quick start, just follow the guide below to launch your own inference"
" experience."
msgstr ""
"如需快速上手，只需按照下面的指南启动你自己的推理体验即可。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:195
msgid "Feature 1:  Prefix Caching"
msgstr "功能 1：前缀缓存"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:197
msgid ""
"You may directly edit the example file at `unified-cache-"
"management/examples/ucm_config_example.yaml`. For more please refer to "
"[Prefix Cache with NFS Store](../user-guide/prefix-cache/nfs_store.md) "
"and [Prefix Cache with Pipeline Store](../user-guide/prefix-"
"cache/pipeline_store.md) document."
msgstr ""
"你可以直接编辑 `unified-cache-management/examples/ucm_config_example.yaml` "
"示例文件。更多信息请参阅 [带 NFS 存储的前缀缓存](../user-guide/prefix-cache/"
"nfs_store.md) 和 [带 Pipeline 存储的前缀缓存](../user-guide/prefix-cache/"
"pipeline_store.md) 文档。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:199
msgid "⚠️ Make sure to replace `/mnt/test` with your actual storage directory."
msgstr "⚠️ 请确保将 `/mnt/test` 替换为你实际使用的存储目录。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:201
msgid "Feature 2:  Sparsity"
msgstr "功能 2：稀疏性"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:203
msgid ""
"The sparse module was not compiled by default. To enable it, set the "
"environment variable `export ENABLE_SPARSE=TRUE` and re-compile the code "
"you built. And uncomment `ucm_sparse_config` code block in `unified-"
"cache-management/examples/ucm_config_example.yaml`."
msgstr ""
"稀疏模块默认不会被编译。要启用它，请设置环境变量 `export ENABLE_SPARSE=TRUE` "
"并重新编译你构建的代码。同时在 `unified-cache-management/examples/"
"ucm_config_example.yaml` 中取消注释 `ucm_sparse_config` 代码块。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:205
msgid "Step 3: Launching Inference"
msgstr "第 3 步：启动推理"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:210
msgid ""
"In the `examples/` directory, you will find the `offline_inference.py` "
"script used for offline inference. Before executing the script, locate "
"line 25 and replace the `UCM_CONFIG_FILE` value with the path to your own"
" configuration file."
msgstr ""
"在 `examples/` 目录中，你会找到用于离线推理的 `offline_inference.py` 脚本。"
"在执行脚本之前，请定位到第 25 行，并将 `UCM_CONFIG_FILE` 的值替换为你自己的"
"配置文件路径。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:222
msgid "Then run following commands:"
msgstr "然后运行以下命令："

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:237
msgid ""
"For online inference , vLLM with our connector can also be deployed as a "
"server that implements the OpenAI API protocol."
msgstr ""
"对于在线推理，带有我们连接器的 vLLM 也可以部署为实现了 OpenAI API 协议的服务器。"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:239
msgid "To start the vLLM server with the Qwen/Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct model, run:"
msgstr "要启动带有 Qwen/Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct 模型的 vLLM 服务器，请运行："

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:259
msgid ""
"**⚠️ The parameter `--no-enable-prefix-caching` is for SSD performance "
"testing, please remove it for production.**"
msgstr ""
"**⚠️ 参数 `--no-enable-prefix-caching` 用于 SSD 性能测试，在生产环境中请将其移除。**"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:261
msgid ""
"**⚠️ Make sure to replace `\"/workspace/unified-cache-"
"management/examples/ucm_config_example.yaml\"` with your actual config "
"file path.**"
msgstr ""
"**⚠️ 请确保将 `\"/workspace/unified-cache-management/examples/"
"ucm_config_example.yaml\"` 替换为你实际的配置文件路径。**"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:263
msgid ""
"**⚠️ The log files of UCM module will be put under `log` directory of the"
" path you start vllm service. To use a custom log path, set `export "
"UCM_LOG_PATH=my_log_dir`.**"
msgstr ""
"**⚠️ UCM 模块的日志文件将放在你启动 vllm 服务路径下的 `log` 目录中。要使用"
"自定义日志路径，请设置 `export UCM_LOG_PATH=my_log_dir`。**"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:266
msgid "If you see log as below:"
msgstr "如果你看到如下日志："

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:274
msgid "Congratulations, you have successfully started the vLLM server with UCM!"
msgstr "恭喜，你已经成功启动了集成 UCM 的 vLLM 服务器！"

#: ../../source/getting-started/quickstart_vllm.md:276
msgid ""
"After successfully started the vLLM server，You can interact with the API "
